B.b3l=s(["reason_changed_mind","reason_wrong_order","reason_item_finished","reason_customer_left"],t.s)
B.b6y=s(["Menu \u2630 \u203a Bill settings: enter Food Place name, address, phone, GSTIN, FSSAI, footer, your UPI ID, taxes, charges and offers. Tap Save.","Menu \u2630 \u203a Table setup: add sections (AC, Garden\u2026) and tables (T1\u2013T10 or A\u2013F).","Menu \u2630 \u203a Menu: add categories, then items with Half / Full price and veg / non-veg mark.","Menu \u2630 \u203a Staff: add Manager, Captain / Waiter, Kitchen and Cashier with their mobile number and a 6-digit PIN.","Menu \u2630 \u203a Permissions: switch ON / OFF what each role can do.","Offer price: Menu \u203a tap an item \u203a switch on Offer price, enter the lower price and (optional) end date. The menu shows the offer price with the old price crossed out.","Settings: choose Theme colour (Saffron, Blue, Green\u2026) and language (English, \u0939\u093f\u0902\u0926\u0940, \u092e\u0930\u093e\u0920\u0940) on each phone.","Bill settings: add your logo, a short address for bills, and switch the waiter / cashier name on bills ON or OFF.","Use Yora on a computer: Settings \u203a Use Yora on computer shows the web address. Log in there with the same mobile number and PIN."],t.s)
B.bty=new A.a4("Getting started (Owner)",B.b6y)
B.b9p=s(["Install the same Yora app on the staff phone and log in with their mobile number and PIN.","Tap Yes to use fingerprint next time.","Forgot PIN? Owner: Staff \u203a \u22ee \u203a Reset PIN. Staff left the job? Switch them OFF."],t.s)
B.bsM=new A.a4("Staff login",B.b9p)
B.b1f=s(["Dine-in shows all tables: Green = free, Amber = occupied, Blue = bill printed.","Tap a table \u203a tap items (choose Half / Full) \u203a tap an item in the order to add a kitchen note \u203a Send to kitchen. A KOT is made.","More items later? Add them and Send again \u2014 only the new items go to the kitchen.",'Food ready: your phone vibrates and shows "Table \u2026 is READY". Serve and tap Mark served.',"Wrong item? Tap \u2715 on it and give a reason. Move or merge tables from the \u22ee menu."],t.s)
B.bsK=new A.a4("Dine-in order (Captain / Waiter)",B.b1f)
B.aGy=s(["Kitchen screen shows KOTs, oldest first, with minutes waiting (red after 20 minutes).","Tap Start preparing, then All ready (or tap single items). The waiter gets an alert.",'With a printer: tap \ud83d\udda8 on a KOT, or set "Print KOT automatically" in Settings \u203a Printers.'],t.s)
B.btw=new A.a4("Kitchen",B.aGy)
B.aXF=s(["Open the table \u203a Make bill. Add customer name / mobile if needed.","Offers apply by themselves. For extra discount choose % or \u20b9 and a reason.","Split bill: By items or Equal. The table turns blue.","View bill / Take payment \u203a Cash, UPI (QR with amount), Card or Split \u203a Paid. The table turns green.","Print, Share PDF or send on WhatsApp from the bill screen.","Need to change items after printing? Owner / Manager: Cancel bill to add / remove items."],t.s)
B.bsV=new A.a4("Bill and payment (Dine-in)",B.aXF)
B.b9u=s(["Parcel \u203a New parcel \u203a customer name and mobile (optional) \u203a add items \u203a Take payment.",'Customer gets a big token number. Kitchen sees "Parcel \xb7 Token \u2026".',"When the customer collects it, tap Hand over."],t.s)
B.bss=new A.a4("Parcel / takeaway",B.b9u)
B.aYZ=s(["Reports: Today, This month, Financial year or your own dates. Print, PDF or Excel.","Excel has the full bill register, tax summary and discount register for your CA.","Staff-wise work: see what each waiter, cashier, kitchen staff and manager did. Tap a name for details.","Day closing at night: opening cash + cash added + cash sales \u2212 cash expenses \u2212 cash taken out = cash that should be in the drawer. Count notes, enter counted cash, Close the day.","Activity log: choose the month at the top; entries are grouped date-wise. Filter by staff or search."],t.s)
B.bsf=new A.a4("Reports and day closing (Owner / Manager)",B.aYZ)
B.b0d=s(["Expenses: choose the category from the list (Vegetables, Gas, Salary\u2026) with Cash / UPI / Card. Cash expenses reduce the cash in day closing.","Owner / Manager: Settings \u203a Expense categories to add, rename, delete or reorder the list.","Stock: add items (onion kg, oil litre\u2026) with an alert level. Use + when you buy and \u2212 when you use. Low items show in red on the home screen."],t.s)
B.btc=new A.a4("Expenses and stock",B.b0d)
B.aVK=s(["When the internet is down a red bar appears. Tap Offline billing.","Choose Parcel or a table, add items, take payment. The KOT and bill print on the Bluetooth printer.","Offline bills get a temporary number like OFF-SAI-261111-K7001. When the internet returns they upload by themselves and get the real bill number.","Menu \u2630 \u203a Offline bills shows each bill: waiting, uploaded (with real number) or failed. Use Sync now to upload.","Open the app once a day with internet so the menu and prices on the phone stay up to date.","Tables that were already open before the internet went down: finish them when the internet returns."],t.s)
B.bsc=new A.a4("No internet? Offline billing",B.aVK)
B.b08=s(["First pair the Bluetooth printer in phone Settings \u203a Bluetooth (PIN usually 0000 or 1234).","Yora \u203a Settings \u203a Printers \u203a Choose printer \u203a Test print. Paper size (58 / 80 mm) is in Bill settings."],t.s)
B.bti=new A.a4("Printer",B.b08)
B.b7S=s(["No internet message: check Wi-Fi / mobile data and pull down to refresh.","Update does not install: install the newest APK from the same source.","Anything else: contact softcollection2027@gmail.com"],t.s)
B.bst=new A.a4("Problems?",B.b7S)
