B.bsk=new A.a4("Children","Yora is for businesses and is not meant for anyone under 18.")
B.bsl=new A.a4("Who can use Yora","Yora is for food businesses. The person who registers must be the owner or be allowed to act for the Food Place, and must be 18 or older. Only the owner and the staff the owner adds should use it.")
B.bsn=new A.a4("Suspension and closing","We may suspend an account for misuse, illegal use, security risk or (once plans start) non-payment, after notice where possible. You can stop using Yora and delete your account anytime: Settings \u203a Delete my account.")
B.bsp=new A.a4("Payments from your customers","Yora does not collect money. Your customers pay you directly (cash, UPI, card). Yora only records it and shows your own UPI QR. We are not a bank or payment company and are not part of any payment dispute.")
B.bsq=new A.a4("Your responsibility for bills and taxes","\u2022 You set prices, taxes (if any), charges, discounts, GSTIN (if any) and FSSAI details. Check they are correct before giving bills.\n\u2022 You are responsible for your business licences, tax registration and returns (GST only if it applies to you), and accounts.\n\u2022 Reports are a help. Please check figures with your CA before filing any return. Yora is not tax or legal advice.")
B.bsr=new A.a4("Security","PINs are hashed, connections are encrypted, and access is limited by role. No system is 100% secure; keep your PIN secret and switch off staff who leave. If a data breach happens we will act quickly and inform the people affected and the authorities as the law requires.")
B.bsw=new A.a4("Data on the phone","\u2022 The login session, language, theme colour and printer choice are kept on the phone.\n\u2022 For offline billing, the menu, tables and bill settings are saved on the phone, and bills made without internet stay on that phone until they upload. Do not clear the app data or uninstall the app while bills are waiting to upload.\n\u2022 Fingerprint login is checked by Android itself. Your fingerprint never leaves the phone and we never receive it.")
B.bsB=new A.a4("Phone permissions","\u2022 Internet: to save and sync data.\n\u2022 Fingerprint (optional): quick login.\n\u2022 Bluetooth / Nearby devices (optional): to print on a Bluetooth printer.")
B.bsC=new A.a4("What we do NOT collect","\u2022 We do not take, hold or process any money. Customers pay the Food Place directly by cash, UPI or card; Yora only records it. We never ask for card numbers, UPI PIN, OTP or bank passwords.\n\u2022 No location, contacts, photos, microphone or camera access.\n\u2022 No advertising, no ad tracking and we do not sell or rent any data.")
B.bsF=new A.a4("Law","This policy follows the laws of India, including the Information Technology Act, 2000 and the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023 as it comes into force.")
B.bsG=new A.a4("Price and subscription","Yora is free during testing. If paid plans start, the price, plan period (monthly / yearly), any free trial and what happens on renewal will be shown in the app before you pay. Payments in the Android app will be made through Google Play, and you can cancel any time in the Play Store (Subscriptions). Refunds will follow the refund policy published then and Google Play's rules.")
B.bsJ=new A.a4("Why the data is used","Only to run Yora for the Food Place: log in staff, take orders, print KOTs and bills, make reports and Excel files, keep the activity log, protect accounts from misuse, give support, and follow the law.")
B.bsL=new A.a4(B.ay,0)
B.bsR=new A.a4("Service","We try to keep Yora running at all times, but there may be breaks for maintenance, internet or cloud problems. We may improve, change or remove features. Important changes will be informed in the app.")
B.qB=new A.PT(0,"left")
B.qC=new A.PT(1,"right")
B.bsX=new A.a4(B.qB,B.qC)
B.bsY=new A.a4(B.ls,B.lt)
B.bt_=new A.a4(B.lt,B.ls)
B.bt0=new A.a4(!1,!1)
B.bt1=new A.a4(!1,null)
B.bt2=new A.a4(!1,!0)
B.bt5=new A.a4(B.lp,B.lq)
B.bt6=new A.a4("Sharing","We share data only with our cloud provider (Supabase) to run the service, or when the law requires it. Data leaves Yora when you choose to share it: printing, sharing a PDF / Excel file or sending a bill on WhatsApp.")
B.bt8=new A.a4("Changes to this policy","If this policy changes, the new version and date will be shown in the app and on our website.")
B.bt9=new A.a4("Offline billing","When the internet is down, Yora can make bills on the phone and upload them when the internet returns. Bills waiting on the phone can be lost if the phone is lost, broken, reset or the app is uninstalled before upload.")
B.btf=new A.a4(B.lq,B.lp)
B.btg=new A.a4("Your data","Your menu, bills, reports and other business data belong to you. You can download them anytime as PDF / Excel.")
B.bth=new A.a4("Changes to these terms","We may update these terms. The date at the top will change and important changes will be shown in the app. Using Yora after that means you accept the new terms.")
B.btj=new A.a4("Your rights","\u2022 See and download your data: Reports \u203a PDF / Excel.\n\u2022 Correct data: edit it in the app, or ask the owner.\n\u2022 Delete data: Settings \u203a Delete my account, or email us.\n\u2022 Complain: write to the Grievance Officer below.")
B.btm=new A.a4("How long data is kept","\u2022 While the account is active, so bills and reports stay available for accounts and taxes.\n\u2022 Owner deletes the account: the Food Place and all its data are deleted from the database at once. Copies in the cloud provider's automatic backups are removed in its normal backup cycle.\n\u2022 Staff deletes the account: the login and mobile number are deleted. The staff name stays on bills and records made by that person, because the Food Place must keep its business records.")
B.btn=new A.a4("Data stored in Yora","\u2022 Food Place details entered by the owner: name, address, phone, GSTIN, FSSAI number, UPI ID, bill settings, taxes, charges and offers.\n\u2022 Owner and staff: name, mobile number and role. The 6-digit PIN is stored only in hashed (scrambled) form; we cannot see it.\n\u2022 Business records: menu, tables, orders, kitchen tickets (KOT), bills, payment mode and amount recorded, discounts and their reasons, expenses, stock, day closing and an activity log of staff actions.\n\u2022 A customer's name and mobile number, only if staff type them on a bill.")
B.bto=new A.a4(!0,!1)
B.btp=new A.a4(!0,!0)
B.btq=new A.a4("Not allowed","Using Yora for anything illegal, fake bills, entering other people's data without a right to, trying to access another Food Place's data, or harming the service.")
B.btr=new A.a4(B.qC,B.qB)
B.btu=new A.a4("Accounts and PINs","\u2022 Keep PINs secret. The owner is responsible for what staff do with their logins.\n\u2022 Switch off or delete staff who leave.\n\u2022 Tell us at once if you think an account is misused.")
B.btv=new A.a4("Who is responsible for which data","\u2022 The Food Place owner decides what business and customer data to enter and why. For that data the Food Place is responsible, and we store and process it only on the Food Place's behalf.\n\u2022 For owner and staff login details we are responsible.")
B.btx=new A.a4("Limitation of liability",'Yora is provided "as is". As far as the law allows, we are not liable for indirect losses or business loss caused by wrong entries, internet, phone or printer problems. This does not remove any right you have by law.')
